        12 => new(
            "The circle is complete. What was lost in Genesis is restored in Revelation. The Holy City, New Jerusalem, descends from heaven to the earth, and God Himself tabernacles with men forever.",
            "The eternal home of the redeemed is not floating in space—it is the New Earth where righteousness dwells, with access to the Tree of Life forever (Rev 21-22).",
